#, fuzzy
msgid "You made it!"
msgstr "해냈어요!"

#: scenes/chase/chase.gd
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"You reached {place} before the pirates! The people of {place} chase the pirates away, and give you"
" {silver} silver."
msgstr "해적보다 먼저 {place}에 도착했어요! {place} 사람들이 해적을 쫓아내고, 은화 {silver}닢을 줬어요."

#: scenes/chase/chase.gd
#, fuzzy
msgid "Caught!"
msgstr "잡혔어요!"

#: scenes/chase/chase.gd
#, fuzzy
msgid "The pirates caught you! They laugh, kiss the prow of your boat, and sail away. Try again?"
msgstr "해적에게 잡혔어요! 해적들은 껄껄 웃더니 뱃머리에 뽀뽀하고 떠나갔어요. 다시 해 볼까요?"

