#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/013_the_foal_is_coming/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"My mare Silke is about to foal, and she is restless. Please fetch Tova from Laxön, quickly! Tova "
"takes the room of a crate in your boat."
msgstr "내 암말 실케가 곧 새끼를 낳는데, 안절부절못해요. 락쇤의 토바를 얼른 데려와 주세요! 토바는 배에서 상자 하나만큼 자리를 차지해요."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/013_the_foal_is_coming/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "A foal? I come at once. Let me sit in the bow."
msgstr "망아지요? 당장 갈게요. 뱃머리에 앉을게요."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/013_the_foal_is_coming/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"A little filly, with white socks! She stands already. When she is grown, she is yours: I promise."
