#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/081_the_healers_round/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Healers' Round"
msgstr "치료사의 순회"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/081_the_healers_round/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"You are ready. Do my round alone today: look at the lambs in Ålberga, the horses in Torsgården and"
" the swans in Svanetorp. Then come and tell me."
msgstr "이제 준비가 됐어요. 오늘은 혼자서 내 순회를 돌아요. 올베랴의 새끼 양, 토르스고르덴의 말, 스바네토르프의 백조를 살펴보고, 나한테 와서 알려 줘요."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/081_the_healers_round/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "You look in their eyes, their ears, their hooves... All well? Good! They like you."
msgstr "눈도 보고, 귀도 보고, 발굽도 보고... 다 괜찮아요? 좋아요! 양들이 잘 따르네요."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/081_the_healers_round/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Bror is old, but well. Silke's new foal is strong. Tell Tova all is fine."
msgstr "브로르는 늙었지만 건강해요. 실케의 새 망아지는 튼튼하고요. 토바에게 다 괜찮다고 전해 줘요."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/081_the_healers_round/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The swans? Fat and happy. One has a sore wing: you wrapped it well."
msgstr "백조요? 통통하고 행복해요. 한 마리가 날개를 다쳤는데, 붕대를 잘 감아 줬네요."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/081_the_healers_round/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"All well, and the swan's wing wrapped? Then take this: your own healer's bag. You are healers now."
msgstr "다 괜찮고, 백조 날개에 붕대도 감았다고요? 그럼 이걸 받아요. 직접 쓸 치료사 가방이에요. 이제 진짜 치료사예요."

#. a gift for a task: 'You get ...'
