#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/095_apples_for_the_market/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Thanks to the bees, my trees are full of apples! Twelve baskets for the market in Kråkhamn. Only "
"your boat can take them all at once."
msgstr "벌 덕분에 나무마다 사과가 주렁주렁해요! 크로크함 시장에 열두 바구니를 가져다주세요. 한 번에 다 실을 수 있는 건 그 큰 배뿐이에요."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/095_apples_for_the_market/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Twelve baskets of apples! The whole market smells of autumn."
msgstr "사과 열두 바구니! 시장 전체에 가을 냄새가 나요."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/095_apples_for_the_market/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Red and green and yellow. Take one for the trip!"
msgstr "빨강, 초록, 노랑. 가는 길에 하나 먹어요!"

